# 110: 1P arcade mash marathon, P1 DONOVAN on the EXTENDED WHEEL (14z-110,
# GitHub #111). Body = 26_don_arcade_mash's mash verbatim (single credit,
# dense chords nonstop through several CPU matches and every transition);
# only the select prologue differs: 26's U,U,R was the STOCK-track path to
# slot 0x0F (Donovan substituted over Jedah, 11_pick_donovan's intent) and
# on the 21-cell WIDE wheel it lands on JEDAH — so 26 soaked Jedah on every
# WIDE build since 14z-64. This replay walks 36_pick_tenant_cell's measured
# path to the appended cell 0x13: L -> 0x05, L -> 0x0A, D -> 0x09 (Aulbath),
# D -> 0x13, confirm.
# 26 is NOT edited: 15 expectation entries, the frozen vanilla masked-v2
# basis log and several measured counts (948 type-6 hits, 228 map entries,
# the guard-corpus control frames) are keyed to it.
# BUILD-ONLY (extended wheel + a tenant at 0x13). Deterministic on one
# emulator+build; a crash-hunt soak, not a cross-emulator comparison.
# Venue-steered CPU-opponent legs: tests/audit_don_vs_cpu.sh.
